    "html": "<p>The gravitational field strength on planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g_{X}\"></span>, the gravitational field strength on planet Y is  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g_{Y}\"></span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g_{X}}{g_{Y}}=\\frac{1}{16}\"></span>. The mass of planet Y is four times the mass of planet X. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{the\\: radius\\: of\\: planet\\: X}{the\\: radius\\: of\\: planet\\: Y}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
